  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Femina-edutainment-region - Femina-edutainment-youth</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Femina-edutainment-region</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Femina HIP anv&#xe4;nder den sk edutainment metoden f&#xf6;r att n&#xe5; ungdomar    med budskap kring hiv/aids, sexuell h&#xe4;lsa och andra                   livsstilsrealterade fr&#xe5;gor. Projektet anv&#xe4;nder popul&#xe4;ra magasin,      tv-talkshow, hemsida f&#xf6;r att driva debatt och ge adekvat information  s&#xe5; att unga m&#xe4;nniskor kan g&#xf6;ra egna val.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Femina HIP uses edutainment as a method to reach a young target group with messages about HIV/AIDS, sexual and reproductive health and      other lifestyle related issues. The project uses popular magazines,   tv-talk show etc to create debate and give adekvate information so    that young people can make their own choices.</narrative>
  </description>
